{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Somewhere, a cat sleeps</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those who have loved a cat.<br>For those who have lost one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk between dream and reality, where time drifts without meaning. You can end everything in five minutes, or wander forever. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the nothingness, the randomness, the endlessness. Forget about time. Read the poems of Khayyam by the fire. Push objects until they fall, or let them stand untouched. Stare into the abyss until it stares back. Do nothing. Do everything. Be like a cat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And when the box opens, and the cats begin to fall, you may find yourself becoming one of them, until it is over.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover fragments of story within stillness and silence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breathe with the cats, and let them rest on you forever</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read timeless poems by Omar Khayyam</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch as cats fall like rain from nowhere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A meditative walking simulator about patience, loss, and the philosophy of felines</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3959480?t=1756152975","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3959480?t=1756152975","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959480/089f59fb1030bc646a724fb58f499010b63b563a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756152975","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959480/089f59fb1030bc646a724fb58f499010b63b563a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756152975","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Somewhere, a cat sleeps</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those who have loved a cat.<br>For those who have lost one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk between dream and reality, where time drifts without meaning. You can end everything in five minutes, or wander forever. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the nothingness, the randomness, the endlessness. Forget about time. Read the poems of Khayyam by the fire. Push objects until they fall, or let them stand untouched. Stare into the abyss until it stares back. Do nothing. Do everything. Be like a cat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And when the box opens, and the cats begin to fall, you may find yourself becoming one of them, until it is over.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover fragments of story within stillness and silence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breathe with the cats, and let them rest on you forever</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read timeless poems by Omar Khayyam</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch as cats fall like rain from nowhere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A meditative walking simulator about patience, loss, and the philosophy of felines</p></li></ul>","developers":["MoldyBits"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959480/da122e201916cf318fa708225d9a927448c04cc8/header.jpg?t=1756152975","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257188754,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257188754/movie480.mp4?t=1756152972","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257188754/movie_max.mp4?t=1756152972"},"name":"Somewhere, a Cat 